# App Router

- Routes are `src/app/<segment>/page.tsx` with a default-exported page component
- Root metadata and chrome live only in `src/app/layout.tsx` — do not nest extra sidebars or top bars in pages
- Pages are Server Components. Do not add `"use client"` to a page just to use `className` or map static arrays
- Use `next/link` and `next/navigation` (`usePathname`). Never `next/router` or `pages/`
- Images in the MVP are static `<img>` URLs; prefer `next/image` only when adding first-party assets or optimizing new local files
- `src/app/globals.css` is the only global stylesheet: Tailwind layers plus `.material-symbols-outlined`, `.glass-card`, and `.hide-scrollbar`

## Page templates

Match the existing page instead of inventing a new shell:

- Dashboard, Alerts, Settings: padded document under the TopBar (`pt-24`, 12-column bento grids)
- Maps: full-viewport overlay (`relative mt-16 h-[calc(100vh-64px)]`) with absolutely positioned glass controls
